        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek Conical Straight Knurled Knob and Dumont Brass Lever with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a special ordered knob by leverset. The exterior is the Conical Straight Knurled Knob and the interior is the Dumont Lever. It has the modern Square Rose.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Knob and Lever Set with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim and rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Conical Knob Exterior with Dumont Lever Interior Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cc-Specification.pdf?v=1704262419\"><b>Emtek Select Conical Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DT-specifications.pdf?v=1704262369\"><b>Emtek Dumont Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knob on exterior, door lever on interior. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 lever, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 lever, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 lever, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordered Item. <b>NO RETURNS</b></i>\r\n</p>",
